# Dependencies
node_modules/

# This project uses pnpm exclusively (see packageManager in package.json
# and pnpm-workspace.yaml) — never commit another package manager's
# lockfile. If package-lock.json or yarn.lock reappears locally, it means
# npm/yarn was run by mistake in this directory; delete it and reinstall
# with `pnpm install`.
package-lock.json
npm-shrinkwrap.json
yarn.lock

